      "message": "You can drop this.  Zephyr provides `CONFIG_I2C_DUMP_MESSAGES` to dump out all I2C transfers.\n\nYou can also enable `CONFIG_I2C_DUMP_MESSAGES_ALLOWLIST` to define only a subset of devices to debug.",
